  "notes": "Refers to predicting future events before they occur. Can be used both for scientific prediction and for supernatural foreknowledge. Also functions as a suru verb ({予知|よち}する).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {地震|じしん}{予知|よち} — earthquake prediction\n- {予知|よち}{能力|のうりょく} — precognitive ability\n- {予知|よち}{夢|ゆめ} — prophetic dream\n- {予知|よち}する — to foresee, to predict\n- {予知|よち}できない — unpredictable\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {予測|よそく} — prediction, forecast (scientific, data-based)\n- {予想|よそう} — expectation, forecast (general, often subjective)\n- {予言|よげん} — prophecy (often mystical or religious)\n\nUSAGE:\n{予知|よち} implies knowing something before it happens, while {予測|よそく} and {予想|よそう} are more about forecasting based on available information. {地震|じしん}{予知|よち} is a frequently discussed topic in Japan.",
